## Best Practices Summary

### Do's ✅
- Use Material Design principles consistently
- Implement proper theming and customization
- Follow accessibility guidelines
- Use appropriate Material components for each use case
- Implement proper form validation
- Use Material icons consistently
- Implement responsive design
- Test Material components thoroughly
- Use Material animations appropriately
- Follow Material Design spacing guidelines

### Don'ts ❌
- Mix Material Design with other design systems
- Ignore accessibility requirements
- Use Material components incorrectly
- Skip form validation
- Over-customize Material components
- Ignore responsive design
- Skip testing Material components
- Use inappropriate icons
- Violate Material Design principles
- Ignore Material Design spacing guidelines

This comprehensive guide ensures proper Angular Material implementation following Material Design principles and best practices.
